# Sioona Product

**Sioona.ai** — “Signals into Revenue”. Overlay conversation intelligence for finance / high-volume chat. Internal engine name **SignalC1** (do not surface in UI).

Sits on top of existing chat tools (Intercom, Zendesk, WhatsApp, etc.). **Not** a chatbot replacement.

## Phase 1 MVP loop (build this)

Ingest export → detect → Shadow Mode Insights → SignalScore feedback → pragmatic adapt (taxonomy overrides) → eval / lift vs baseline.

Prove domain signal detection beats the customer’s current process with enough precision to earn trust.

**Domain adaptation in Phase 1** = merge partner SignalScore feedback into store taxonomy overrides used by `detect.ts`. Not QLoRA / vLLM / LangGraph.

## In scope

- Chat ingest (Sioona CSV/JSON, Intercom JSON export, WhatsApp Business `.txt`)
- Core signals: `lead`, `retention`, `upsell`
- Scoring, summaries, suggested actions (**display-only**)
- Insights dashboard + Shadow Mode review queue
- SignalScore feedback (`accept` / `reject` / `wrong_reason`)
- Taxonomy overrides from rejects / wrong_reason; partner baseline + lift
- Conversation `groundTruth` labeling for partner eval
- Basic eval (labeled + human-review precision, ≥80% go/no-go)

## Out of scope unless explicitly asked

- Autonomous actions, computer-use, agent swarm
- Auth0 / Neon / pgvector / vLLM / LangGraph / QLoRA scaffolds
- Live Intercom/WhatsApp webhooks
- Outcome-based billing, on-prem, chatbot replacement
- Navy+cyan or Slash/gold branding (UI SoT is Geist rule)

